  "title": "red violet to Present at the East Coast IDEAS Investor Conference",
  "summary": "BOCA RATON, Fla., May 28, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Red Violet, Inc. (NASDAQ: RDVT), a leading analytics and information solutions provider, today announced that it will present at the East Coast IDEAS Investor Conference being held June 10-11, 2026 in New York. Camilo Ramirez, Senior Vice President, Finance and Investor Relations, will present and host investor meetings on June 11, 2026. About red violet®At red violet,",
